on":[0,0,0,0.0]},"move":{"r1":0.0411,"r5":0.0546,"r1_spy":0.0448,"r5_spy":0.0715}}],"quotes":[{"c":"TDW 2018 Q1","e":"tdw","d":"2018-05-15","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"John T. Rynd","x":"Our streamlining initiatives have continued to take effect through the first quarter, driving down our G&A below our previously reported target of $25 million.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/05/16/tidewater-tdw-q1-2018-earnings-conference-call-tra.aspx"},{"c":"TDW 2018 Q1","e":"tdw","d":"2018-05-15","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"John T. Rynd","x":"While I am pleased with our team's progress with reducing cost, we will continue to look at the company's operating footprint and associated shore-based cost in order to identify opportunities for additional cost savings and achieve the company's near-term objectives of reaching cash flow breakeven.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/05/16/tidewater-tdw-q1-2018-earnings-conference-call-tra.aspx"},{"c":"TDW 2018 Q2","e":"tdw","d":"2018-08-14","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"John Rynd","x":"So we think we do have some potential pricing power in certain of our markets as this utilization and prompt availability gets to where it needs to be.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/08/14/tidewater-inc-tdw-q2-2018-earnings-conference-call.aspx"},{"c":"TDW 2018 Q2","e":"tdw","d":"2018-08-14","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"John Rynd","x":"At Tidewater, our progress in right-sizing our business and balance sheet have prepared the company to successfully manage through the ongoing challenge of the OSV business and to be in a good position to respond as opportunities and market conditions warrant.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/08/14/tidewater-inc-tdw-q2-2018-earnings-conference-call.aspx"},{"c":"TDW 2018 Q2","e":"tdw","d":"2018-08-14","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"John Rynd","x":"Since our financial reorganization was completed last year, our focus remains on streamlining our operations and rationalizing our shore based footprint all while remaining dedicated to providing a safe environment for our employees, high-quality service to our clients around the world and of…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/08/14/tidewater-inc-tdw-q2-2018-earnings-conference-call.aspx"},{"c":"TDW 2018 Q4","e":"tdw","d":"2019-03-01","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"John Rynd","x":"Quinn has been a key member of the Tidewater leadership team and his expertise, vision and professionalism were instrumental in navigating the company through restructuring process.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/03/01/tidewater-inc-tdw-q4-2018-earnings-conference-call.aspx"},{"c":"TDW 2018 Q4","e":"tdw","d":"2019-03-01","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Quintin V. Kneen","x":"In addition, we are continuing to pursue ways to further streamline the business and we will update you next quarter on our progress and improving that objective even further.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/03/01/tidewater-inc-tdw-q4-2018-earnings-conference-call.aspx"},{"c":"TDW 2019 Q1","e":"tdw","d":"2019-05-07","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Quintin V. Kneen","x":"You may recall from the last quarter that this pertains to severance costs associated with the merger and relates principally to the accelerated vesting of stock grants.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/07/tidewater-inc-tdw-q1-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"TDW 2019 Q1","e":"tdw","d":"2019-05-07","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Quintin V. Kneen","x":"We are taking steps every day to reduce headcount, professional fees, travel and other G&A costs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/07/tidewater-inc-tdw-q1-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"TDW 2019 Q2","e":"tdw","d":"2019-08-13","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"John T. Rynd","x":"Cost reduction possibly resulted from one-time favorable adjustment to insurance reserves and reductions associated with disposal of stack vessels that resulted in lower stack cost.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/13/tidewater-inc-tdw-q2-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"TDW 2019 Q2","e":"tdw","d":"2019-08-13","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"John T. Rynd","x":"We will continue to find ways of gaining efficiency and cost savings in our business and we look forward to updating you on our progress.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/13/tidewater-inc-tdw-q2-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"TDW 2019 Q3","e":"tdw","d":"2019-11-12","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Quintin V. Kneen","x":"The first S-3 will be to register some of the warrants that are outstanding from the restructuring and the 2018 merger.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/12/tidewater-inc-tdw-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"TDW 2019 Q3","e":"tdw","d":"2019-11-12","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Quintin V. Kneen","x":"It includes $6.3 million of severance-related costs due to the staffing changes we affected before the end of the quarter, including the wages and benefits of those individuals for the full quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/12/tidewater-inc-tdw-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"TDW 2019 Q4","e":"tdw","d":"2020-03-03","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Quintin V. Kneen","x":"Based on our efforts to streamline the organization, we anticipate G&A expense to be $83 million for 2020, a cash flow improvement of at least $10 million when compared to 2019 G&A expense of $104 million.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/03/04/tidewater-inc-tdw-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"TDW 2020 Q1","e":"tdw","d":"2020-05-12","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Quintin V. Kneen","x":"Shrinking involves severance cost per personnel, the cost of shuttering offices and the cost of demobilizing vessels and inherently inefficient process as fully crude vessels without revenue or burning fuel.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/12/tidewater-inc-tdw-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"TDW 2020 Q1","e":"tdw","d":"2020-05-12","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Quintin V. Kneen","x":"Our customers appeared to understand that these cost savings cannot come from their supply chain this time, but downward pressure on prices continues regardless.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/12/tidewater-inc-tdw-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"TDW 2020 Q2","e":"tdw","d":"2020-07-31","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Quintin V. Kneen","x":"The significant restructuring of our executive management and corporate administrative functions in 2019 and ongoing cost measures resulted in this 12% decrease in G&A expense per active day, down from $1,587 million in the prior year to $1,401 million in the second quarter of this year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/31/tidewater-inc-tdw-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"TDW 2020 Q2","e":"tdw","d":"2020-07-31","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Peter Ehret","x":"So you just, I guess it's kind of sounds like hey, we're on -- so maybe the verge of some formal restructuring processes, but not quite there yet.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/31/tidewater-inc-tdw-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"TDW 2020 Q3","e":"tdw","d":"2020-11-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Quintin V. Kneen","x":"…quarter, we anticipate higher fuel costs related to vessels transiting to their lay-up position, excess salaries and de-crude the vessels, which is what we've experienced in the second and third quarters, and then an increase in the lump sum 